  "source": "Slab2 — Hayes, G.P., Moore, G.L., Portner, D.E., Hearne, M., Flamme, H., Furtney, M. & Smoczyk, G.M. (2018), Slab2, a comprehensive subduction zone geometry model, Science 362, 58-61",
